This product includes design work derived from pi (pi-mono), specifically the
structure of context compaction, the practice of pushing an agent's working set
into the prompt rather than relying on recall, the separation of steering from
aborting, and per-model configuration of context windows and provider quirks.

It also includes source derived from pi: the usage arithmetic in
src/store/pi-storage.ts (emptyUsage, addUsage) follows pi's
harness/utils/usage.js, which its export map does not publish. The same file
implements pi's durable Storage contract, and test/pi-storage.ts runs pi's own
storage conformance suite against it.

